# Keep up to 5 images for Ubuntu Core projects
ubuntu-core 3
ubuntu-appliance 2

# Floor for the daily image types: never leave fewer than this many image
# sets on the server, however old they are, so that a run of failed builds
# can't strip a tree down to a single daily.  Combined with purge-days, which
# still trims anything older than the cut-off once this many are kept.
daily 2
daily-live 2
daily-dangerous 2
daily-preinstalled 2
daily-canary 2
daily-legacy 2
daily-minimal 2
dvd 2
